WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.792 --> 01:30.665
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.638 --> 01:33.919
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.795 --> 01:35.838
Black Jack.

01:52.530 --> 01:55.741
Unico brought me a four-leaf clover.

01:56.284 --> 01:59.467
I think my wish will finally come true.

01:59.953 --> 02:03.171
I'll confess my love to the prince tomorrow.

02:04.754 --> 02:06.121
Unico

02:04.754 --> 02:06.121
The Love Clover

02:08.338 --> 02:10.631
I'm sure love will be victorious.

02:15.595 --> 02:18.832
Hey, what would you like for dinner?

02:19.057 --> 02:19.921
Hm.

02:23.853 --> 02:26.554
There is no food called "hm".

02:26.773 --> 02:27.460
Hm.

02:29.150 --> 02:30.192
HEY!

02:30.193 --> 02:33.362
At least look at me when you're talking to me!

02:33.363 --> 02:33.941
Hm.

02:37.049 --> 02:40.116
Based on Tezuka Osamu's "Pinoco Love Story"

02:37.049 --> 02:40.116
Project Grown-Up Pinoco

02:45.208 --> 02:47.035
You're so good.

02:47.293 --> 02:49.433
Sir, what's good today?

02:49.496 --> 02:52.098
The red snapper, of course!

02:52.364 --> 02:54.341
Then give me some swordfish.

02:54.342 --> 02:55.217
Sure.

03:19.742 --> 03:23.995
It's only hard to find one when I want one.

03:25.494 --> 03:26.455
There's one!

03:33.381 --> 03:34.256
Here you are.

03:34.541 --> 03:35.391
Go ahead.

03:40.471 --> 03:41.721
Thank you.

03:42.765 --> 03:48.311
So, did you know that a four-leaf clover
makes your wish come true?

03:48.312 --> 03:49.187
Yeah.

03:49.706 --> 03:52.073
I'm glad we found one.

03:52.483 --> 03:53.316
Not yet.

03:54.902 --> 03:58.488
We haven't found one for you.

04:06.414 --> 04:10.500
Four-leaf clover, where are you?

04:12.461 --> 04:14.296
I don't think there's another one.

04:14.297 --> 04:15.964
Four-leaf clover, four-leaf clover...

04:15.965 --> 04:17.048
It's getting dark.

04:17.049 --> 04:18.278
It's okay.

04:19.927 --> 04:21.511
I found one!

04:21.512 --> 04:23.471
The four-leaf clover!

04:24.390 --> 04:26.558
Your face is all muddy.

04:28.186 --> 04:29.686
Yours too.

04:31.898 --> 04:34.981
By the way, I haven't told you my name.

04:35.401 --> 04:36.776
I'm Pinoco.

04:36.777 --> 04:37.944
Nice to meet you.

04:37.945 --> 04:39.568
I'm Tinq.

04:40.239 --> 04:42.272
Nice to meet you.

04:44.137 --> 04:48.363
What are you going to wish for on your four-leaf clover?

04:50.583 --> 04:53.049
What about you?

04:53.321 --> 04:55.063
I... I...

04:56.339 --> 04:57.642
I don't know.

04:58.758 --> 05:01.092
You don't know?

05:12.605 --> 05:14.606
Hey, Doc,

05:15.358 --> 05:17.312
how do you spell "koi"?

05:17.693 --> 05:18.891
Why do you ask?

05:19.236 --> 05:20.675
Never mind that.

05:20.882 --> 05:21.718
Just tell me.

05:25.076 --> 05:26.117
Thank you.

05:28.913 --> 05:31.557
Hey, how do you spell "ai”?

05:34.710 --> 05:35.442
"Ai"?

05:36.253 --> 05:39.673
"Ai," as in love and caring?

05:41.258 --> 05:44.177
What other "ai" is there?

05:44.306 --> 05:47.263
What are you writing?

05:49.016 --> 05:50.474
Thank you.

05:55.815 --> 05:58.858
I'm thinking about...

06:00.861 --> 06:03.363
I'm in love...

06:03.364 --> 06:04.364
A love letter?

06:07.076 --> 06:08.391
Don't read it!

06:08.604 --> 06:10.203
Why not?

06:12.540 --> 06:14.185
Who's it for?

06:14.709 --> 06:16.546
You fell in love?

06:16.711 --> 06:19.295
You don't have to ask me everything!

06:19.296 --> 06:20.964
I am eighteen years old.

06:20.965 --> 06:23.492
I can be in love.

06:23.801 --> 06:26.761
Can't you at least tell me?

06:27.596 --> 06:30.411
I like my privacy!

06:31.058 --> 06:32.642
Oh, yeah?

06:32.643 --> 06:34.695
Then let me tell you something.

06:35.604 --> 06:37.564
About the "koi" I just showed you...

06:38.673 --> 06:41.253
In koi...?

06:39.733 --> 06:41.443
That's koi as in a type of fish.

06:41.481 --> 06:45.625
Letter: "Koi"

06:44.238 --> 06:45.625
This is hopeless.

06:47.908 --> 06:49.993
Hey Pinoco, give me a hand.

06:50.703 --> 06:51.575
Are you going out?

06:51.745 --> 06:53.922
Respect my privacy.

06:58.210 --> 07:00.003
Hey, let's go to the playground.

07:00.004 --> 07:01.082
Sure.

07:03.466 --> 07:04.841
I want to play on the see-saw.

07:04.842 --> 07:06.995
I finally learned how to play on it.

07:07.386 --> 07:08.553
Let's go.

07:14.602 --> 07:16.269
Isn't it fun, Pinoco-chan?

07:22.568 --> 07:23.943
Isn't it fun?

07:24.743 --> 07:25.451
It is.

07:25.882 --> 07:28.531
Then how about the swing?

07:28.532 --> 07:29.467
Want to play house?

07:29.658 --> 07:30.580
Tell riddles?

07:31.660 --> 07:32.924
So boring.

07:33.871 --> 07:36.677
I don't get it!

07:36.999 --> 07:38.795
Then let's play lovers!

07:39.501 --> 07:40.627
What's that?

07:43.339 --> 07:48.843
We sit on a bench next to each other, like this.

07:51.513 --> 07:56.809
And we say nothing and hold each other's hand.

07:58.437 --> 07:59.644
That's boring.

07:59.813 --> 08:01.333
What are you talking about?

08:01.565 --> 08:03.782
It's about to get good.

08:04.443 --> 08:05.360
Good?

08:05.583 --> 08:06.444
Yeah.

08:06.445 --> 08:07.926
Close your eyes.

08:08.447 --> 08:09.364
Why?

08:09.365 --> 08:10.865
Just close them.

08:10.866 --> 08:11.658
Yeah.

08:18.457 --> 08:20.625
Get... get...

08:20.626 --> 08:22.710
Sharaku, what are you doing?

08:22.711 --> 08:26.506
I'd like to ask you the same thing!

08:26.507 --> 08:27.199
Us?

08:27.739 --> 08:28.739
Kissing.

08:28.968 --> 08:30.802
Kiss?!

08:33.138 --> 08:34.514
Let's go, Tinq.

08:34.515 --> 08:35.069
Right.

08:37.434 --> 08:39.560
Ohmigewdness!

08:46.443 --> 08:47.694
Look at the bird!

08:47.793 --> 08:48.820
Pinoco-chan!

08:48.821 --> 08:50.029
Yeah.

08:54.952 --> 08:57.203
It caught a fish.

08:57.997 --> 08:59.956
Let's go, Ting.

09:03.246 --> 09:06.587
I don't know how to get home after coming this far.

09:06.588 --> 09:08.756
We'll be fine.

09:09.216 --> 09:11.684
We're almost at the movie theater.

09:12.845 --> 09:14.721
Let's run, Tinq!

09:21.019 --> 09:22.618
Don't follow us!

09:25.983 --> 09:26.899
Let's go.

09:30.195 --> 09:33.573
This is what we should do right now.

09:34.199 --> 09:37.702
<i>That's a movie for grownups!</i>

09:37.939 --> 09:39.704
You have something to say?

09:40.706 --> 09:42.582
I want to watch that one.

09:48.297 --> 09:52.133
Lovers wouldn't watch that.

09:52.134 --> 09:53.384
Two for adults.

09:54.303 --> 09:55.678
Huh?

09:55.679 --> 09:57.889
You two are kids.

09:57.890 --> 10:00.099
No we aren't!

10:00.142 --> 10:02.351
I am eighteen years old.

10:03.979 --> 10:04.854
Yeah, yeah.

10:04.855 --> 10:06.814
Here you are. ¥1,400 please.

10:07.441 --> 10:09.942
We're not kids!

10:09.943 --> 10:11.903
It's been discounted.

10:12.404 --> 10:15.865
Well, fine, then.

10:16.241 --> 10:17.408
One kid.

10:18.744 --> 10:20.495
You're an adult!

10:21.663 --> 10:23.039
No, I'm not!

10:23.040 --> 10:25.090
I'm an Akobono Junior High student.

10:26.335 --> 10:29.758
The sun is out, but your body is only getting colder.

10:30.088 --> 10:31.964
Hiromi! Don't die!

10:31.965 --> 10:33.049
I'm here.

10:33.050 --> 10:34.410
I'm right here!

10:34.801 --> 10:37.303
To me, you're like my...

10:37.679 --> 10:40.649
I didn't understand the movie much, but it was fun.

10:40.849 --> 10:41.510
See you again.

10:41.510 --> 10:43.059
Yup, see you again.

10:54.874 --> 11:02.497
So, so. Ting and I were in a really
good mood right about then.

11:02.955 --> 11:05.164
Do you want to hear the rest?

11:05.165 --> 11:06.123
Not really.

11:11.171 --> 11:15.341
Am I not attractive?

11:15.801 --> 11:17.927
Hey, Pinoco, go to bed already.

11:18.275 --> 11:19.553
Why?

11:19.554 --> 11:21.097
It's time for Kids to go to bed.

11:22.432 --> 11:25.792
Jeez! I'm not a kid!

11:26.186 --> 11:29.855
I'll grow up, then!

11:44.607 --> 11:45.830
Pongo!

11:47.046 --> 11:51.544
What should I do?!

12:06.018 --> 12:07.977
Hey, Pinoco, where's the food?

12:09.604 --> 12:10.604
Pinoco?!

12:10.605 --> 12:11.731
What are you doing?!

12:11.732 --> 12:14.025
Am I pretty?

12:14.026 --> 12:15.484
Stop joking around!

12:17.237 --> 12:18.320
Why?

12:18.447 --> 12:20.656
You're young, so get that straight!

12:25.759 --> 12:26.532
Fine.

12:31.835 --> 12:33.919
Doc!

12:35.417 --> 12:37.194
The dress is all knotted up.

12:45.015 --> 12:46.724
Oh, Pinoco-chan.

12:48.602 --> 12:51.131
Pinoco-chan, is he your friend?

12:51.556 --> 12:54.667
No, no. He's my lover.

12:57.068 --> 12:58.486
I see.

12:59.321 --> 13:00.196
Her lover!

13:00.363 --> 13:01.280
Her lover!

13:01.281 --> 13:02.782
Cock-a-doodle-doo!

13:03.325 --> 13:06.952
So, Pinoco's handsome man, what would you like?

13:06.953 --> 13:07.912
Fruit...

13:07.913 --> 13:09.329
Two coffees!

13:09.668 --> 13:10.668
Black.

13:11.214 --> 13:12.214
Black?!

13:13.794 --> 13:14.554
This?

13:14.681 --> 13:15.248
Yup.

13:16.708 --> 13:18.068
Ready?

13:18.375 --> 13:19.183
But...

13:19.633 --> 13:21.133
Just drink it.

13:21.134 --> 13:24.576
Grownup lovers drink coffee at a cafe.

13:25.597 --> 13:27.341
Pinoco-chan, I'm scared.

13:27.682 --> 13:28.849
Ready, Ting?

13:28.850 --> 13:29.558
Yeah.

13:31.102 --> 13:32.061
Yuck.

13:33.396 --> 13:35.105
Pinoco-chan, I...

13:37.859 --> 13:39.068
Where are you going?

13:39.069 --> 13:41.570
I'm not about to interrupt two lovers on a date.

13:56.461 --> 13:59.046
Pinoco-chan, you love him, right?

13:59.422 --> 14:02.434
Oh, no, that's not true!

14:02.634 --> 14:03.717
Don't you?

14:03.718 --> 14:04.635
Yeah.

14:06.179 --> 14:07.429
We must have heard the air.

14:08.223 --> 14:10.516
So I hate being a kid.

14:10.517 --> 14:13.602
That's why you wanted to become a grownup.

14:16.898 --> 14:18.023
Me too...

14:23.572 --> 14:25.531
I wish I could be a grownup.

14:37.796 --> 14:39.003
Done!

14:40.503 --> 14:42.996
Signs: "Doc"
Love!!
Love

14:44.843 --> 14:47.370
Why does this always happen?

14:48.847 --> 14:51.473
Doc, you meanie...

14:56.813 --> 14:58.605
Doctor!

14:58.940 --> 15:00.780
Please save our son!

15:01.067 --> 15:04.862
I heard your daughter is his friend.

15:07.377 --> 15:09.014
<i>He's Pinoco's..</i>

15:09.409 --> 15:12.077
Tinq! What's wrong?

15:12.078 --> 15:15.372
I felt like the heavens were guiding
me, so we brought him here.

15:15.570 --> 15:18.000
He started having a fever earlier in the evening,

15:18.001 --> 15:20.878
and he would roll around in pain
and say that his stomach hurts.

15:30.548 --> 15:32.306
His heart is on his right side.

15:34.100 --> 15:36.644
Is the heart the only organ that is flipped?

15:37.020 --> 15:41.607
According to the doctor, he has situs inversus.

15:41.608 --> 15:45.087
All his organs are flipped.

15:45.737 --> 15:47.780
Let's perform an ultrasound examination.

15:49.532 --> 15:51.011
This is rare.

15:51.493 --> 15:52.785
The appendix is on the left side.

15:52.786 --> 15:53.826
The liver is on the left side too.

15:54.037 --> 15:55.162
The spleen is on the right side.

15:55.558 --> 15:56.617
It's completely mirrored!

15:57.040 --> 15:58.471
Doctor...

15:58.525 --> 16:01.035
I occasionally see people with their heart on their right.

16:01.961 --> 16:04.843
But those people usually have other
abnormalities with their internal organs.

16:05.256 --> 16:07.395
They frequently have other problems with those organs.

16:07.801 --> 16:09.259
Ow...

16:09.260 --> 16:10.719
Owie...

16:10.720 --> 16:11.720
It hurts!

16:12.151 --> 16:13.347
Where does it hurt?

16:15.892 --> 16:17.726
It's swollen just to the left of the pit.

16:18.478 --> 16:20.047
It would be swollen on the right normally.

16:20.563 --> 16:22.205
That's where the gallbladder or bile duct is.

16:22.774 --> 16:24.525
I see symptoms of jaundice too.

16:24.526 --> 16:26.693
It's a case of congenital biliary dilation.

16:27.606 --> 16:28.459
Owie.

16:28.499 --> 16:29.297
Tinq!

16:29.554 --> 16:30.594
Does it hurt?

16:30.647 --> 16:32.087
What should we do?

16:32.325 --> 16:36.578
Dr. Black Jack! Please treat him quickly!

16:36.579 --> 16:38.910
We can't stand just watching this!

16:39.332 --> 16:41.291
Doctor, what's wrong?

16:42.585 --> 16:45.956
<i>I know exactly where everything is in a person.</i>

16:46.297 --> 16:50.717
<i>I know every single blood vessel and nerve cell, and their
location, and how they are placed in relation to each other.</i>

16:51.636 --> 16:54.964
<i>But if that placement is flipped...</i>

16:55.640 --> 16:57.243
<i>this will be difficult.</i>

16:58.302 --> 16:59.302
Doctor...

16:59.695 --> 17:00.615
I will do it.

17:00.937 --> 17:02.702
But I need 20,000,000 yen for it.

17:10.199 --> 17:12.239
What's wrong, Doc?

17:14.617 --> 17:17.680
You look different than usual.

17:18.621 --> 17:19.702
It's nothing.

17:20.290 --> 17:21.123
Let's begin.

17:28.172 --> 17:28.839
Scalpel.

17:28.840 --> 17:29.798
Here.

17:31.426 --> 17:34.132
We'll make an incision below the ribs.

17:34.554 --> 17:35.394
Clamps.

17:40.935 --> 17:42.561
<i>Just as I suspected.</i>

17:43.187 --> 17:46.231
<i>All of his blood vessels, nerves, and
everything else are flipped!</i>

17:46.847 --> 17:48.293
Pinoco, wipe the sweat off.

17:48.610 --> 17:50.193
You look troubled.

17:50.194 --> 17:51.537
Don't talk to me!

17:53.114 --> 17:54.573
<i>Damn!</i>

17:54.574 --> 17:58.285
<i>I didn't know it was so hard when it's flipped backwards.</i>

17:59.329 --> 18:01.121
<i>Everything is flipped.</i>

18:09.130 --> 18:09.824
Clamps.

18:10.173 --> 18:11.214
Pinoco, clamps.

18:11.215 --> 18:12.632
Hang on!

18:15.303 --> 18:15.929
Here!

18:19.849 --> 18:21.725
Look in a mirror, Doc.

18:21.726 --> 18:24.227
A mirror flips everything.

18:26.022 --> 18:26.986
That's right!

18:27.440 --> 18:29.941
<i>The mirror image of a mirror image.</i>

18:29.942 --> 18:31.066
<i>So that's the right way.</i>

18:31.861 --> 18:34.529
OK, Pinoco, hold it just like that.

18:34.530 --> 18:35.238
Right.

18:36.657 --> 18:38.408
Tilt the mirror more towards me.

18:38.951 --> 18:39.701
Good.

18:39.702 --> 18:40.535
Don't move it.

18:53.508 --> 18:54.466
I can't see it!

18:54.467 --> 18:55.342
Tilt it more!

18:55.343 --> 18:56.051
Yes!

18:57.220 --> 18:58.095
Good.

19:00.890 --> 19:03.233
Good, I'm done with the mirror.

19:03.726 --> 19:05.435
I just need to stitch.

19:12.276 --> 19:13.151
Pinoco!

19:13.444 --> 19:14.069
Pinoco!

19:15.321 --> 19:17.405
Your lover was saved.

19:18.366 --> 19:20.742
He's not my lover!

19:22.703 --> 19:24.996
<i>I'm) glad for you, Ting.</i>

19:31.671 --> 19:33.957
Your son was saved.

19:34.549 --> 19:37.592
His bile duct must have been dilated since birth.

19:38.886 --> 19:40.265
Thank you very much.

19:43.057 --> 19:45.475
Please thank Pinoco.

19:47.103 --> 19:49.479
She's a wonderful assistant.

19:50.523 --> 19:51.565
Also...

20:12.044 --> 20:17.508
It was a kid's writing, so it took us
a while to figure out the address.

20:17.925 --> 20:19.968
<i>Is this Pinoco's love letter?</i>

20:19.969 --> 20:21.052
<i>It came back?</i>

20:22.371 --> 20:24.331
Dr. Black Jack

20:22.722 --> 20:24.162
<i>It's for me?!</i>

20:24.515 --> 20:25.348
Bye.

20:27.268 --> 20:29.311
About the sender of this letter...

20:32.315 --> 20:33.607
she's not a kid.

20:41.532 --> 20:45.417
I haven't cooked in a while.

20:45.828 --> 20:47.912
I'll do a good job again.

20:49.874 --> 20:53.593
Doc loves the curry I make.

20:53.878 --> 20:54.961
I'm tired.

20:54.962 --> 20:56.963
Let's get some rest.

20:59.717 --> 21:04.512
A little lady shouldn't carry such a heavy load.

21:04.513 --> 21:07.182
Oh? Pinoco-chan, you aren't with him today?

21:07.183 --> 21:07.905
What the?!

21:07.989 --> 21:08.850
Where are you?

21:08.851 --> 21:10.101
Come out!

21:11.729 --> 21:13.755
You know, him?

21:15.024 --> 21:16.566
You mean, Ting?

21:17.860 --> 21:20.487
So, what happened?

21:21.614 --> 21:22.989
With Ting?

21:24.700 --> 21:26.900
I quit playing lovers.

21:27.119 --> 21:30.116
Anyway, Sharaku, you look funny.

21:30.834 --> 21:31.834
Playing?

21:32.047 --> 21:33.190
That means...

21:38.547 --> 21:41.633
Sharaku! There's no time for laughing!

21:41.634 --> 21:43.593
We must go home and fix some curry!

21:43.594 --> 21:44.927
Help me!

21:45.221 --> 21:46.137
Yeah!

21:46.138 --> 21:47.972
Follow me, Sharaku!

21:47.973 --> 21:50.350
I need to do this quickly.

21:50.351 --> 21:52.102
Pinoco-chan!

22:01.676 --> 22:05.316
Letter: Doc, I love you

22:07.160 --> 22:19.115
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.160 --> 22:19.115
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.233 --> 22:24.232
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.233 --> 22:24.232
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.801 --> 22:31.270
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.801 --> 22:31.270
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.814 --> 22:37.272
